    <string name="length_hint">Tap reaction runs 5, 10 or 20 trials. The other modes scale the same way.</string>
    <string name="settings_haptics">Vibrate on tap</string>
    <string name="settings_timing_title">About timing</string>
    <string name="settings_timing_body">Times run from the first moment the stimulus can be on screen to the moment the touchscreen registers your finger, using the system\'s own touch timestamps. Sound reaction times start when the audio system reports the beep reached the speaker, so speaker delay isn\'t counted against you. Every phone adds a little display and touch delay, so the fairest comparison is you against yourself on the same device.</string>
